# ReScript: ReScript language manual (v11): overview, primitive types, string interpolation; requirements/languages/rescript.md
name     rescript res resi

keyword  let rec type module open include if else switch for while in to downto try catch exception
keyword  external mutable and as assert lazy async await private constraint when
type     int float string bool unit array list option promise char
builtin  true false None Some Ok Error

line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
string   ` `  : escapes multiline interp=dollar-braces
escape        : x=2 u4
sigil    @    : meta
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
upper-type
calls
